#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/users/user.py:477
msgid ""
"Incoming e-mails for this user are copied/redirected to the specified "
"forward e-mail addresses. Depending on the forwarding setting, a local copy "
"of each e-mail is kept. If no forwarding e-mail addresses are specified, the"
" e-mails are always kept in the user's mailbox."
